 "body_text": "Back to Blog\n\n Austin Kayak Tours\n\n After a fun summer, we made some moves to start Austin kayak tours called Lone Star Kayak Tours.  These kayak tours will be in-between Austin, Texas and San Antonio, Texas.  The two tours will be a kayak tour of the Congress city Bat Bridge during May through October and a kayak trip of San Marcos River, just in-between the two cities that will run all year long.   The water on the San Marcos is brilliantly blue and the Bats are magnificent sight to see.\n\nTake some time to keep exploring the outdoors, be it on a kayak, a bike or a paddle board.  Get outside and stay active.\n\nDavid\n\n Posted in: \n\n Activities\n\n Adventure\n\n eco-tours\n\n Kayaking\n\n Stand-up Paddle Boarding\n\n Winter Destinations\n\nTweet\n\n Email\n\n Previous Post\n\n Next Post",
